WEBVTT

00:00:03.170 --> 00:00:06.000
The 45th Annual Seikan Festival!

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:06.000
45th Annual

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:06.000
Seikan Festival!

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.540
Let the fun begin!

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:10.960
Seikan Festival

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:25.380
You're just pretending not to notice, aren't you?

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:28.420
Mother of the Goddess' Dormitory

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:28.290
I can see the truth in your eyes

00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:31.290
This isn't some sort of dramatic romance

00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:34.920
My flushed body feels like it could melt

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:37.880
Honestly, I'm just being shy

00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:40.830
Let me stir up feelings deep inside

00:00:40.830 --> 00:00:43.580
I'll dress you in this outfit

00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:46.540
See? My heart races for nobody but you

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:51.960
It is what it is, take it as it comes, just go with the flow

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:54.960
If you peer through the other side of the glass

00:00:54.960 --> 00:00:58.380
You'll see a world of charming sweeties

00:00:58.670 --> 00:01:03.880
Face to face, hold me in your arms, squeeze me tight

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:06.830
I want you so close to my side that

00:01:06.830 --> 00:01:09.210
I can feel your pulse

00:01:09.880 --> 00:01:11.540
Ooey-gooey love

00:01:11.540 --> 00:01:15.830
My feelings for you get jumbled up by naughty love

00:01:15.830 --> 00:01:17.380
Ooey-gooey love

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:22.130
Whatever you want, do as you like, I don't mind

00:01:22.130 --> 00:01:24.830
Tracing my fingers along your skin

00:01:24.830 --> 00:01:28.250
I'll show you a syrupy-sweet dream

00:01:28.250 --> 00:01:30.880
When I stare at your lips

00:01:31.330 --> 00:01:34.040
I wanna kiss you more and more

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:46.040
Episode 7

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:46.040
The School Festival at Seikan Women's University

