Bubble milk tea!

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:52.830
Bubble Milk

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:52.830
Tea

00:01:51.130 --> 00:01:52.830
Would you like to try some?

00:01:52.830 --> 00:01:53.960
Here you go!

00:01:52.830 --> 00:01:55.710
Cotton Candy

00:01:52.830 --> 00:01:55.710
¥200

00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:55.710
Yay, thanks!

00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:57.130
Whoa...

00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:57.460
Seikan Festival

00:01:57.670 --> 00:02:00.170
College festivals sure are big.

00:02:00.170 --> 00:02:02.880
Too many people. It looks stuffy in there.

00:02:03.170 --> 00:02:04.830
Koushi!

00:02:05.210 --> 00:02:07.040
Sutea!

00:02:08.210 --> 00:02:09.790
Come on in!

00:02:13.580 --> 00:02:15.580
What kind of outfit is that, Miss Frey...?

00:02:16.670 --> 00:02:18.460
It's an Anna Miller's uniform.

00:02:18.460 --> 00:02:20.330
And the armband...?

00:02:20.330 --> 00:02:25.830
Executive Committee

00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:22.960
Y'see, as part of the Fashion Club,

00:02:22.960 --> 00:02:25.830
I'm supplying several of the other departments
with their costumes.

00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:29.130
I volunteered since I already have
connections with almost everyone.

00:02:29.130 --> 00:02:32.500
That makes sense.
So you're on the festival's executive committee?

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:33.210
Yup!

00:02:33.540 --> 00:02:36.290
That's why I know where to find all the best stuff.

00:02:36.290 --> 00:02:37.830
I'll give you the grand tour!

00:02:38.170 --> 00:02:39.330
Thank you very mu-

00:02:39.580 --> 00:02:41.130
I hope you have fun too, Sutea!

00:02:41.130 --> 00:02:42.380
Ugh, let go!

00:02:42.380 --> 00:02:44.460
But I'm cold in these short sleeves!

00:02:44.460 --> 00:02:46.080
Well I'm hot!

00:02:46.080 --> 00:02:48.210
Looks like Sutea fits right in.

00:02:48.920 --> 00:02:52.210
Aw, don't be such a meanie!
And it doesn't look like anyone recognizes me
from the time I dressed as a girl...

00:02:52.210 --> 00:02:54.460
Why won't you talk to me?!
I'm gonna make the most of this festival!

00:02:54.460 --> 00:02:56.500
Takoyaki, fried chicken!

00:02:57.750 --> 00:02:59.790
As for our first stop...

00:03:00.210 --> 00:03:02.580
The Apothecary of Amazement

00:03:00.790 --> 00:03:02.380
...how about this place?

00:03:04.420 --> 00:03:06.170
"Apothecary of Amazement"...?

00:03:06.170 --> 00:03:08.630
It's a little hole-in-the-wall
not listed in the brochure.

00:03:08.920 --> 00:03:13.170
Um, it seems kind of far from
the rest of the refreshment stands...

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:15.500
Never mind that. Just go inside!

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:16.710
W..wait a minu-

00:03:17.960 --> 00:03:19.210
Ouch...

00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:23.790
Welcome to the Seikan Festival Shadow Realm.

00:03:23.790 --> 00:03:29.830
Here, you may purchase elixirs with a wide range
of effects that cannot be procured elsewhere.

00:03:25.710 --> 00:03:28.330
Show your true colors

00:03:25.710 --> 00:03:28.330
UNMASK YOURSELF

00:03:30.790 --> 00:03:31.920
Well?

00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:34.290
What are you doing, Miss Mineru?!

00:03:34.460 --> 00:03:36.500
I'm selling some of my homemade remedies.

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:38.420
To earn a little extra cash.

00:03:38.420 --> 00:03:40.330
Is this stuff safe?

00:03:40.330 --> 00:03:41.330
Who knows?

00:03:41.330 --> 00:03:42.420
Excuse me?!

00:03:42.630 --> 00:03:44.500
C'mon, just give 'em a try!

00:03:44.790 --> 00:03:47.750
This one will make anyone who
drinks it uncontrollably horny.

00:03:47.750 --> 00:03:51.920
And this one is an aphrodisiac that will bring
just about anyone to their knees...

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:57.330
Are you allowed to sell this kind of
experimental stuff at school...?

00:03:57.540 --> 00:03:59.670
Oh, no. Absolutely not.

00:03:59.670 --> 00:04:00.670
Which is why...

00:04:02.130 --> 00:04:04.420
Illegal sales at an unauthorized booth detected!

00:04:04.420 --> 00:04:06.080
Operations will cease immediately!

00:04:09.210 --> 00:04:09.920
Huh?!

00:04:09.920 --> 00:04:10.750
Pardon me!

00:04:12.130 --> 00:04:13.670
Farewell, my friends!

00:04:13.670 --> 00:04:14.670
Come back!

00:04:14.670 --> 00:04:17.330
This happens to Mineru every year.

00:04:19.830 --> 00:04:23.710
The presentation that Serene's participating in
should be starting any minute now.

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:26.750
Miss Serene? Is it a play or something?

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:29.380
You'll just have to see for yourselves!

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:35.710
Incredible!!

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:35.710
An Unidentified Creature has Been Spotted

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:35.710
at Seikan Women's University!!

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:38.330
We, the Occult Research Society,

00:04:38.330 --> 00:04:40.210
are about to disclose all of
the classified information

00:04:40.210 --> 00:04:42.080
that we've gathered as a product
of our club activities!

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:43.670
"Classified information"?

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:45.420
Where's Miss Serene?

00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:51.040
The subject of our investigation is not one of
the cryptids with which the public is familiar.

00:04:51.580 --> 00:04:55.330
It's an entirely new species that often appears
here at Seikan Women's University.

00:04:55.580 --> 00:04:57.040
The discovery of a lifetime...

00:04:57.040 --> 00:04:59.250
Allow me to introduce this miraculous new creature!

00:05:00.290 --> 00:05:02.880
It's currently unknown how many years
she's been enrolled here...

00:05:02.880 --> 00:05:04.580
Serene Hozumi!

00:05:04.790 --> 00:05:06.040
That's what you meant?!

00:05:06.040 --> 00:05:07.380
A research subject?!

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:10.710
The frequency with which she appears
on campus is extremely low,

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:12.500
and sighting her is considered an omen.

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:13.710
She's an urban legend come to life-!

00:05:13.710 --> 00:05:14.540
Madam President!
She's an urban legend come to life-!

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:15.040
Madam President!

00:05:15.670 --> 00:05:18.130
An eyewitness spotted her
near the refreshment stands!

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:19.130
What?!

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:21.540
All members of the Occult Research Society, move out!

00:05:19.330 --> 00:05:21.710
Occult Research Society, All Hands on Deck

00:05:21.540 --> 00:05:25.750
Today is the day that we will capture this
elusive new creature, Serene Hozumi, alive!

00:05:25.920 --> 00:05:26.710
Huh?!

00:05:26.710 --> 00:05:29.540
Oh no! They're going to capture Serene!

00:05:29.540 --> 00:05:32.500
And dissect her.
Maybe even put her on display.

00:05:35.130 --> 00:05:36.830
W-we're wasting precious time!

00:05:36.830 --> 00:05:38.250
Let's go after them!

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:44.960
WHAT'S GOING ON OUT HERE?!

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:56.250
I-it looks like there's some sort of pink mist
covering the refreshments area...

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:58.790
It smells sickly sweet, too...

00:05:58.790 --> 00:06:01.460
The lilies of love are blooming
in full force, aren't they?

00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:05.460
What the heck happened?!

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:07.130
Madam President, your thoughts?!

00:06:07.420 --> 00:06:09.170
Such bizarre circumstances...

00:06:09.170 --> 00:06:10.920
Could this be the work of Serene Hozumi?!

00:06:10.920 --> 00:06:11.880
Wha-?

00:06:11.880 --> 00:06:14.040
Hold on.
That seems like a stretch, don't you think?

00:06:17.290 --> 00:06:19.290
Set your mind and body free!

00:06:17.290 --> 00:06:19.290
MADLY IN LUST

00:06:21.130 --> 00:06:23.210
One of Miss Mineru's elixirs...

00:06:26.460 --> 00:06:28.500
Is that what caused this mess...?

00:06:26.710 --> 00:06:30.210
Effects & Benefits

00:06:26.710 --> 00:06:30.210
Sexual desire and-

00:06:26.710 --> 00:06:30.210
temporarily increase-

00:06:26.710 --> 00:06:30.210
production of hormones-

00:06:28.500 --> 00:06:30.210
Uh, excuse me.

00:06:30.210 --> 00:06:32.580
Haven't we met before?

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:33.580
Huh?

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:39.170
Y-you've got the wrong guy!

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:41.710
Really? Are you sure?

00:06:41.710 --> 00:06:43.290
I-I'm positive!

00:06:43.290 --> 00:06:44.210
There!

00:06:46.080 --> 00:06:48.710
Why did you bring this with you?!

00:06:48.710 --> 00:06:49.000
I knew it!

00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:50.580
I knew it!
In case of an emergency, of course.

00:06:50.580 --> 00:06:51.080
In case of an emergency, of course.

00:06:51.080 --> 00:06:52.830
But why would you pull it out now?!

00:06:53.130 --> 00:06:54.250
Because...

00:06:55.580 --> 00:06:58.790
...the female version of you is simply irresistible.

00:06:59.540 --> 00:07:00.920
This is bad...

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:03.380
The mist is beginning to affect Miss Frey, too.

00:07:03.380 --> 00:07:04.790
Isn't he adorable?

00:07:04.790 --> 00:07:06.210
He's so soft and feminine!

00:07:08.750 --> 00:07:10.130
O-oh crap!

00:07:11.670 --> 00:07:14.420
C'mere, sweetie, let's be friends!

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:16.460
What a cutie!

00:07:16.460 --> 00:07:19.210
Don't worry. I promise to be gentle!

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:24.710
Wait, stop-!

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:27.750
Please don't touch me there...!

00:07:29.170 --> 00:07:32.130
GET YOUR HANDS OFF OF KOUSHI!

00:07:33.580 --> 00:07:35.210
My goodness...

00:07:35.210 --> 00:07:37.210
The little loli is adorable, too!

00:07:38.540 --> 00:07:40.960
Let me show you how it's done...

00:07:40.960 --> 00:07:43.670
Relax. Don't be afraid...

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:49.250
S-Sutea!

00:07:51.330 --> 00:07:53.170
Close encounters of the third kind...

00:07:53.170 --> 00:07:55.920
Open your eyes to a whole new world!

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:57.210
The Secret Garden!!

00:07:57.210 --> 00:07:58.460
The Secret Garden!!

00:07:57.210 --> 00:07:58.460
A Whole New World

00:08:01.130 --> 00:08:02.460
S-somebody...!

00:08:02.460 --> 00:08:04.920
Cut it out!

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:07.880
PLEASE HELP US!

00:08:12.460 --> 00:08:14.290
Focus all lasers on me.

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:22.330
Settle down.

00:08:32.460 --> 00:08:34.540
What were we doing just now...?

00:08:34.540 --> 00:08:37.000
Has everyone come to their senses...?

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:39.580
Miss Serene!

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:46.380
Applying lunar technology to
a large number of humans

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:49.000
has created an acute power shortage.

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:53.500
Did Miss Serene use her mysterious powers
to calm them down...?

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:54.040
Nothing fazes him anymore

00:08:56.130 --> 00:08:57.670
Thank you, Miss Serene.

00:08:57.670 --> 00:09:00.170
For coming to our rescue, I mean.

00:09:01.130 --> 00:09:04.790
Miss Frey and Sutea are out looking for
something to eat right now.

00:09:04.790 --> 00:09:09.080
Will a snack help replenish this "power"
that you mentioned earlier?

00:09:09.580 --> 00:09:12.000
Food is but a temporary solution.

00:09:12.630 --> 00:09:17.710
Physical contact between servant and master
is a far more efficient method of consumption.

00:09:18.040 --> 00:09:19.710
"Physical contact"...?

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:23.290
Most effective of which is...

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:25.500
...a kiss.

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:28.000
Wh-

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:30.080
SERIOUSLY?!

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:32.250
I knew it wasn't a dream!

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:35.080
H-how am I supposed to act normal
around Miss Serene now...?!

00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:36.540
Don't be upset.

00:09:36.920 --> 00:09:39.960
You are not the only servant of mine
who resides in the dormitory.

00:09:39.960 --> 00:09:42.830
Really? So does that mean...?

00:09:44.290 --> 00:09:47.290
While on the verge of slumber,
I made a pact with the others.

00:09:47.290 --> 00:09:48.830
Every night, we engage in-

00:09:49.170 --> 00:09:51.880
Okay, never mind! Spare me the details!

00:09:51.880 --> 00:09:54.500
However, you are the only one here.

00:09:54.790 --> 00:09:58.330
Furthermore, you are accommodating
towards Serene's needs.

00:09:58.670 --> 00:09:59.920
In which case...

00:10:00.080 --> 00:10:02.500
H-hold on, Miss Serene...!

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:07.420
I-I understand that "physical contact"
is really important to her, but...

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:10.960
But I...!

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:15.330
What are you doing?

00:10:15.750 --> 00:10:16.920
Nothing...

00:10:17.210 --> 00:10:18.630
Oh, I almost forgot.

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:20.830
Here, we brought you back a snack.

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:27.540
What a pleasing shape!

00:10:32.040 --> 00:10:34.040
Miss Atena's working at a café?

00:10:34.040 --> 00:10:34.920
Yup.

00:10:34.920 --> 00:10:38.040
We have a little time left before
Kiriya's event starts,

00:10:38.040 --> 00:10:39.580
so let's make a quick detour.

00:10:39.580 --> 00:10:43.000
Wow, a café run by Miss Atena...?

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:44.920
I can hardly wait!

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:49.540
Childhood Studies

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:49.540
Freshmen

00:10:47.090 --> 00:10:49.540
Maid Café

00:10:48.330 --> 00:10:49.540
Saotome!

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:51.960
How's it going? Are you dressed?

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:53.790
Oh, um, almost.

00:10:53.790 --> 00:10:56.500
Sorry for asking you to help out
at the last minute...

00:10:56.830 --> 00:10:57.790
No problem.

00:10:57.790 --> 00:11:00.250
I'll see you out there once you're
finished getting changed.

00:11:00.710 --> 00:11:01.710
'Kay!

00:11:05.420 --> 00:11:07.330
It's a good opportunity to practice.

00:11:07.330 --> 00:11:08.880
I have to get better at this.

00:11:09.380 --> 00:11:10.290
That's right.

00:11:10.290 --> 00:11:13.040
I have to get used to guys other than Koushi...!

00:11:18.420 --> 00:11:20.420
Agh, so awkward!

00:11:20.420 --> 00:11:23.000
Maybe waiting tables was a little too ambitious...!

00:11:23.750 --> 00:11:24.710
Welco-

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:27.460
A maid...

00:11:27.460 --> 00:11:28.790
Yup, she sure is.

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:32.130
W-welshome to our humble cashé...

00:11:32.130 --> 00:11:34.250
T-table for shree?

00:11:34.250 --> 00:11:35.290
She survived.

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:36.500
Just barely.

00:11:40.330 --> 00:11:42.670
I never would've guessed that it was a maid café...

00:11:42.670 --> 00:11:45.040
And it looks pretty professional, too.

00:11:48.290 --> 00:11:49.790
Do you like maid outfits?

00:11:49.790 --> 00:11:51.080
N-no, I...!

00:11:52.420 --> 00:11:57.460
Th..th..thank you for your patience, M..Master-

00:12:00.630 --> 00:12:02.830
TH-TH-THE CAKE AND THE TEA!

00:12:02.830 --> 00:12:05.080
Relax. I caught it.

00:12:05.380 --> 00:12:07.670
Th-thank goodness...

00:12:07.670 --> 00:12:09.750
M-Miss Atena...

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:13.540
I-I'm sorry!

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:16.210
Oh, I mean, um...

00:12:16.830 --> 00:12:21.420
M-my sincerest apologies... Master.

00:12:22.500 --> 00:12:24.670
No, no! It was my fault!

00:12:25.830 --> 00:12:27.130
I'm glad you're okay.

00:12:27.130 --> 00:12:28.830
Both you and your maid outfit.

00:12:28.830 --> 00:12:31.830
U-uh... thanks.

00:12:31.830 --> 00:12:35.130
A-alrighty then! It's off to work I go!

00:12:35.880 --> 00:12:38.210
W-welcome to our humble café.

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:41.080
You're an awfully cute maid.

00:12:42.170 --> 00:12:44.130
If you aren't busy, wanna tour the festival with us?

00:12:44.130 --> 00:12:45.420
When do you get off?

00:12:45.420 --> 00:12:48.290
U-um, I...

00:12:48.290 --> 00:12:49.330
Miss Atena!

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:50.380
Wait.

00:12:54.420 --> 00:12:57.790
Sorry, but I'm afraid I can't take you up on that.

00:12:59.080 --> 00:13:01.170
Aw, that's too bad.

00:13:02.040 --> 00:13:04.250
It must be tough for her.

00:13:04.580 --> 00:13:09.000
To tell you the truth, going to the beach for
the first time was probably difficult enough.

00:13:09.540 --> 00:13:13.460
But this time, she's making a conscious effort
to interact with men.

00:13:15.380 --> 00:13:18.000
Miss Atena's trying really hard, isn't she?

00:13:18.460 --> 00:13:22.040
Keeping an eye on someone from afar
is another way of protecting them.

00:13:22.580 --> 00:13:23.710
You're right.

00:13:24.330 --> 00:13:27.080
I think Atena's doing her best to change.

00:13:27.460 --> 00:13:29.210
For a certain someone.

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:32.540
Why are you laughing?

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:34.040
Oh, no reason.

00:13:34.630 --> 00:13:36.330
Staff Only

00:13:34.630 --> 00:13:36.330
Kitchen

00:13:34.630 --> 00:13:36.330
Back Room

00:13:34.630 --> 00:13:36.330
[Do Not Enter]

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:38.290
That was nerve-racking!

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:39.580
You did great.

00:13:39.580 --> 00:13:43.080
And I'm sorry. I heard that you
don't much care for men...

00:13:43.080 --> 00:13:48.290
True. But I'm slowly trying to get more comfortable
around guys other than Koushi.

00:13:49.330 --> 00:13:51.500
Is Koushi that kid out there?

00:13:52.750 --> 00:13:54.630
What a cute little boyfriend!

00:13:55.130 --> 00:13:57.000
Y-you've got it all wrong!

00:13:57.000 --> 00:14:00.710
He's nothing more than, um...
He's like a younger brother!

00:14:00.710 --> 00:14:03.460
Huh? I could've sworn you had a younger sister...

00:14:03.920 --> 00:14:06.750
You might say I have a brother and a sister!

00:14:06.750 --> 00:14:08.000
Hm...

00:14:08.250 --> 00:14:11.880
I'm a kinda confused, but...
he's like family to you, right?

00:14:11.880 --> 00:14:13.880
E-exactly! He's family!

00:14:13.880 --> 00:14:15.290
Now I get it.

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:18.250
You're the doting older sister type,
aren't you, Saotome?

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:20.880
Oh, well... I, um...

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:22.830
I'm not quite there yet, but...

00:14:22.830 --> 00:14:24.580
I'd like to be.

00:14:25.920 --> 00:14:29.000
Here's an idea: Why not spend
some time with him?

00:14:29.000 --> 00:14:29.880
Huh?!

00:14:29.880 --> 00:14:32.040
You might as well. Go walk around together.

00:14:32.380 --> 00:14:34.460
But won't you be short-staffed...?

00:14:34.460 --> 00:14:35.830
Leave it to me!

00:14:38.170 --> 00:14:42.130
While you go on a break,
this little maid will take over your shift!

00:14:42.540 --> 00:14:45.880
If Atena's the clumsy yet lovable maid,
then this girl is...

00:14:47.630 --> 00:14:49.210
...the tsundere maid!

00:14:49.210 --> 00:14:50.290
Sutea?!

00:14:50.290 --> 00:14:52.080
Wow, she's a natural!

00:14:52.080 --> 00:14:53.710
Wh-whatever...

00:14:53.710 --> 00:14:56.960
It's not like I said I wanted to
wear a maid outfit or anything...

00:14:57.380 --> 00:14:59.670
Miss Frey, this area's only for-

00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:01.920
Wh-what's going on...?

00:15:05.630 --> 00:15:07.420
We've got it covered.

00:15:07.830 --> 00:15:09.830
Just relax and have a nice break, okay?

00:15:11.880 --> 00:15:13.540
You and Koushi.

00:15:18.080 --> 00:15:20.880
She was very insistent,
so I just went along with it, but...

00:15:20.880 --> 00:15:23.630
I totally forgot to change out of my maid outfit.

00:15:23.630 --> 00:15:26.880
Well, plenty of other people
are wearing costumes.

00:15:26.880 --> 00:15:28.170
Yeah, but...

00:15:28.170 --> 00:15:30.040
Besides, um...

00:15:30.630 --> 00:15:33.460
...it looks really good on you.

00:15:33.460 --> 00:15:36.630
I think it'd be a waste for you to take it off...

00:15:39.080 --> 00:15:41.080
Thanks. I appreciate it.

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:53.630
5th Annual Seikan Women's University

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:53.630
Cross-Dressing Contest

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:51.170
Without further ado, let the 5th Annual Seikan
Women's University Cross-Dressing Contest begin!

00:15:51.170 --> 00:15:53.500
These three handsome contestants...

00:15:53.830 --> 00:15:55.670
are this year's finalists!

00:15:56.960 --> 00:15:59.250
But where's Miss Kiriya...?

00:15:59.710 --> 00:16:02.630
And judging today's contest is none other than...

00:16:02.630 --> 00:16:08.130
the president of the School Festival Executive
Committee and last year's winner: Kiriya Sensho!

00:16:08.130 --> 00:16:09.000
Huh?!

00:16:09.130 --> 00:16:09.960
Kiriya!

00:16:09.960 --> 00:16:11.500
Prince Kiriya!

00:16:11.500 --> 00:16:13.330
Miss Kiriya looks so cool!

00:16:13.790 --> 00:16:16.250
And she's really popular with the crowd!

00:16:16.250 --> 00:16:17.210
Yeah...

00:16:17.540 --> 00:16:19.380
M-Miss Atena, too...?

00:16:20.210 --> 00:16:22.040
She's almost like a rock star...

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:24.540
Everyone's all riled up.

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:26.630
In fact, it's getting kind of hot in here...

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:28.630
Oh yeah, my bag.

00:16:33.500 --> 00:16:35.000
That wasn't tea!

00:16:35.000 --> 00:16:36.580
B-but how?!

00:16:36.790 --> 00:16:39.500
What type of weird elixir did I just drink...?!

00:16:39.500 --> 00:16:41.500
Show your true colors

00:16:39.500 --> 00:16:41.500
UNMASK YOURSELF

00:16:41.500 --> 00:16:44.130
"Show your true colors"...?

00:16:44.130 --> 00:16:46.630
What's gonna happen to me?!

00:16:48.170 --> 00:16:51.130
Aw, thanks for coming to support me.

00:16:51.130 --> 00:16:52.380
I appreciate it.

00:16:52.580 --> 00:16:54.880
You were insanely cool out there!

00:16:54.880 --> 00:16:57.630
Thanks. You're pretty cute, yourself.

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:01.630
What's the matter, Koushi?

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:04.290
It's, uh, nothing...

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:05.540
Are you sure?

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:06.920
Oh, that reminds me.

00:17:06.920 --> 00:17:09.420
I got these as a gift for judging the contest.

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:11.170
-Admission Ticket-

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:11.170
An IRL Maze Game

00:17:09.830 --> 00:17:10.920
The maze...!

00:17:11.170 --> 00:17:12.330
I have three of them.

00:17:12.330 --> 00:17:13.710
How about we go together?

00:17:14.250 --> 00:17:19.170
I really wanted to check it out,
but I should head back to the café soon...

00:17:19.540 --> 00:17:21.290
Oh, were you on a break?

00:17:22.080 --> 00:17:23.830
I WANNA GO!

00:17:24.710 --> 00:17:26.880
Er, um, I mean...

00:17:26.880 --> 00:17:29.460
Crap! Is this an effect of the elixir?!

00:17:31.130 --> 00:17:33.210
You like that type of stuff, Koushi?

00:17:33.210 --> 00:17:37.420
Come to think of it, my little brother
used to be a big fan of maze games, too.

00:17:37.670 --> 00:17:39.580
Then we oughtta check it out, right?

00:17:39.580 --> 00:17:40.750
Let's do it.

00:17:40.750 --> 00:17:43.960
Besides, it's rare to see Koushi
so passionate about something.

00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:46.920
I'm excited, but this could be bad...

00:17:47.380 --> 00:17:50.170
Please don't let anything else happen...!

00:17:47.380 --> 00:17:52.330
IRL Maze Game

00:17:47.380 --> 00:17:52.330
Entrance

00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:52.330
Welcome to our IRL maze!

00:17:53.380 --> 00:17:57.540
Anyone who manages to solve the puzzle
will be presented with a special medal.

00:17:55.920 --> 00:17:58.080
You are a Hero

00:17:59.040 --> 00:18:00.630
What a cute idea.

00:18:00.630 --> 00:18:02.750
I bet little kids would love this.

00:18:03.920 --> 00:18:07.000
S-SO AWESOME! SUPER-MEGA-AWESOME!

00:18:07.460 --> 00:18:08.580
Koushi...?

00:18:09.920 --> 00:18:11.580
Let's kick that maze's butt!

00:18:11.580 --> 00:18:12.830
O-okay...

00:18:11.580 --> 00:18:15.330
IRL Maze Game

00:18:13.210 --> 00:18:15.330
Well then, have a good time!

00:18:19.750 --> 00:18:21.250
You shall paaaaay!

00:18:23.880 --> 00:18:25.750
Does this scare you...?

00:18:25.920 --> 00:18:29.080
No one told me that it was gonna be
like a horror movie!

00:18:29.080 --> 00:18:32.000
It's so spooky! I'm terrified, but I love it!

00:18:36.210 --> 00:18:39.290
Back, demon!
How dare you scare Miss Kiriya like that?!

00:18:39.290 --> 00:18:40.540
Take this! And this!

00:18:40.960 --> 00:18:42.380
Koushi...?

00:18:42.790 --> 00:18:44.330
Rest assured, Miss Kiriya!

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:48.040
I'll keep us safe and find a way
out of this maze, just you watch!

00:18:48.790 --> 00:18:50.460
Th-thanks...

00:18:58.880 --> 00:19:01.000
Koushi seems to be enjoying himself.
Ouch! Knock it off! Stop it!

00:19:01.000 --> 00:19:02.380
He does.
Ouch! Knock it off! Stop it!

00:19:02.670 --> 00:19:04.960
But something feels off, don't you think?

00:19:04.960 --> 00:19:08.170
Like he's actually acting his age all of a sudden...

00:19:08.170 --> 00:19:09.630
Y-you're right...

00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:11.750
Is it 'cause of the festival?

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:14.330
Maybe. But...

00:19:16.290 --> 00:19:20.540
...part of me wishes that he'd show
this side of himself more often, y'know?

00:19:22.250 --> 00:19:23.960
You're amazing, Atena.

00:19:24.750 --> 00:19:25.880
Alright!

00:19:26.210 --> 00:19:28.420
I might as well make the most of these clothes.

00:19:28.960 --> 00:19:29.960
Koushi!

00:19:30.330 --> 00:19:31.330
Huh?

00:19:33.330 --> 00:19:36.420
This creepy maze terrifies the hell out of me.

00:19:36.420 --> 00:19:39.580
But when I'm with you, I feel fearless.

00:19:40.630 --> 00:19:42.380
R-right...

00:19:42.920 --> 00:19:45.000
Let's work together and solve this thing.

00:19:45.000 --> 00:19:47.080
Hand in hand, until we reach the finish line.

00:19:48.210 --> 00:19:49.750
M-me, too!

00:19:50.670 --> 00:19:52.210
This is the least I can do!

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:54.250
So...

00:19:54.670 --> 00:19:57.670
Will you stay by my side...

00:19:58.080 --> 00:19:59.080
the whole time?

00:20:01.080 --> 00:20:03.080
Time for the Darkness of Dread!

00:20:03.080 --> 00:20:05.790
Follow along the walls
and head for the finish line!

00:20:06.380 --> 00:20:07.250
Wha-?!

00:20:07.250 --> 00:20:08.500
Isn't it, like, way too dark in here?!

00:20:08.500 --> 00:20:10.040
I can't see a thing!

00:20:10.040 --> 00:20:11.830
All we can do is follow along the-

00:20:12.670 --> 00:20:13.670
Whoa-!

00:20:18.960 --> 00:20:20.380
Ow-ow-ow...

00:20:20.710 --> 00:20:23.750
Wait, why didn't that... hurt?

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:33.420
I'M SO SORRY!

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:36.080
Show your true colors

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:36.080
UNMASK YOURSELF

00:20:35.170 --> 00:20:36.080
Huh?

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:38.750
You drank the elixir?

00:20:38.750 --> 00:20:40.130
How'd it go?

00:20:40.130 --> 00:20:42.920
Sure enough, I made a fool out of myself...

00:20:43.130 --> 00:20:45.580
Really? I put ordinary water in that one.

00:20:46.210 --> 00:20:50.330
I mixed a few of those in with the real vials
as a way of testing out the placebo effect.

00:20:51.080 --> 00:20:52.170
Water?!

00:20:52.880 --> 00:20:56.960
So then I... acted like a complete idiot
of my own free will...?!

00:20:57.380 --> 00:21:01.500
After all that blathering on I did about doing
the protecting instead of being protected?!

00:21:04.250 --> 00:21:07.750
I wish my brain would make up its mind already!

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:10.630
It seems like you had a good time.

00:21:10.630 --> 00:21:12.210
Did anything interesting happen?

00:21:12.210 --> 00:21:13.790
N-no, of course not!
N-nope, nothing!

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:15.330
Are you suuure?

00:21:17.880 --> 00:21:19.920
The café was a lot of fun, too.

00:21:20.670 --> 00:21:23.880
We got a chance to see Sutea's
customer service skills in action.

00:21:25.000 --> 00:21:27.630
Do NOT touch me.
Don't come near me, either.

00:21:27.630 --> 00:21:30.630
I despise anything that's
stuffy and hot and sweaty.

00:21:30.630 --> 00:21:33.040
But I'll do you the honor of stepping on you.

00:21:33.040 --> 00:21:34.380
Thank you so much!

00:21:34.380 --> 00:21:35.750
Please step on me, next!

00:21:36.080 --> 00:21:39.750
She's less of a tsundere maid
and more of a gracious queen.

00:21:39.750 --> 00:21:41.790
Come back here!

00:21:44.630 --> 00:21:47.710
Turn yourself in, Serene Hozumi!

00:21:47.710 --> 00:21:49.580
Mineru Wachi has been located!

00:21:49.790 --> 00:21:51.580
Hold it!

00:21:51.880 --> 00:21:54.420
Stop! Don't let her get away!

00:21:58.790 --> 00:22:00.710
Prince Kiriya!

00:22:01.330 --> 00:22:02.880
Wait for me!

00:22:04.580 --> 00:22:06.830
Yes! Incredible! More!

00:22:06.830 --> 00:22:08.290
Uh...

00:22:08.500 --> 00:22:10.000
Come back!

00:22:14.210 --> 00:22:15.630
This is chaos.

00:22:17.210 --> 00:22:20.960
You are a Hero

00:22:17.790 --> 00:22:19.420
Total chaos...

00:22:25.130 --> 00:22:26.630
It's gotta be you

00:22:26.750 --> 00:22:28.380
It's gotta be you

00:22:28.500 --> 00:22:29.960
It's gotta be you

00:22:29.960 --> 00:22:32.130
I'm sure of it, but...

00:22:32.130 --> 00:22:33.790
I can't admit it

00:22:33.790 --> 00:22:35.580
I'll never admit it

00:22:35.580 --> 00:22:37.170
And the truth is

00:22:37.170 --> 00:22:39.330
I wanna tell you

00:22:39.330 --> 00:22:42.420
You're still just like a child

00:22:42.670 --> 00:22:46.040
Blind to everything around you

00:22:46.290 --> 00:22:49.330
Those nonchalant actions of yours

00:22:49.330 --> 00:22:52.790
Make my heart skip a beat

00:22:53.830 --> 00:22:55.790
Why do I think

00:22:55.790 --> 00:22:57.580
Of someone like her

00:22:57.580 --> 00:22:59.420
As a rival?

00:22:59.420 --> 00:23:01.080
It's bizzare

00:23:01.080 --> 00:23:03.670
The longer that I live with you

00:23:03.670 --> 00:23:09.500
The more that everyone seems to change

00:23:10.500 --> 00:23:13.170
Hey! I love your bashful side

00:23:13.170 --> 00:23:14.960
And your serious side, too

00:23:14.960 --> 00:23:18.250
I always, always want you by my side

00:23:18.250 --> 00:23:20.290
Aah! This position that I'm in

00:23:20.290 --> 00:23:21.960
I don't wanna give it up

00:23:21.960 --> 00:23:23.750
I wanna profess my love!

00:23:23.750 --> 00:23:27.080
Our hectic daily life together

00:23:27.290 --> 00:23:30.080
I wish it could go on forever

00:23:30.080 --> 00:23:30.670
It's like

00:23:30.670 --> 00:23:31.290
When you're here

00:23:31.420 --> 00:23:32.040
When you're here

00:23:32.040 --> 00:23:32.790
Next to me

00:23:32.790 --> 00:23:34.630
I can't help but blush

00:23:34.630 --> 00:23:35.880
It's gotta be you

00:23:36.000 --> 00:23:37.540
It's gotta be you

00:23:37.670 --> 00:23:39.290
It's gotta be you

00:23:39.290 --> 00:23:41.460
I'm sure of it, but...

00:23:41.460 --> 00:23:43.080
I can't admit it

00:23:43.080 --> 00:23:44.880
I'll never admit it

00:23:44.880 --> 00:23:46.460
And the truth is

00:23:46.460 --> 00:23:50.040
I wanna tell you, but...

00:23:53.170 --> 00:23:54.630
Koushi is a reindeer.

00:23:54.630 --> 00:23:56.420
Serene and Kiriya are Santa.

00:23:56.420 --> 00:23:58.670
The question is, who will be the first to mount him?

00:23:58.670 --> 00:24:00.130
M-mount him?!

00:24:00.330 --> 00:24:01.830
So as to ride him like a horse.

00:24:01.830 --> 00:24:03.130
In other words, cowgirl posi-

00:24:03.540 --> 00:24:04.880
No, no way!

00:24:05.170 --> 00:24:07.500
I'll let Koushi mount me, instead!

00:24:07.500 --> 00:24:09.420
That has its own set of implications.

00:24:07.500 --> 00:24:11.040
Kiriya Wishes Upon a Christmas
